  itemName: TestNote
  itemDescription: test description
  fullNoteContent: "This is a test note\ni need something to fill the space so pretend
    cool lore is here\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.
    Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad
    minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea
    commodo consequat. \n\nDuis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit
    esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat
    non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\n\nRandom
    thought: Why is it that when we lose something, it's always in the last place
    we look? Well, obviously, because once we find it, we stop looking. But that
    doesn't make it any less annoying. \n\nThe quick brown fox jumps over the lazy
    dog. Then the dog woke up and wondered why a fox was jumping over him in the
    first place. It was a very confusing Tuesday for everyone involved. \n\n1234567890.
    Counting is fun. Sometimes I like to count the pixels on the screen, but then
    I get a headache. Did you know that if you type \"random\" enough times, it starts
    to look like a fake word? Random. Random. Random. Random. Random. \n\nFinal page
    test! If you can see this, your pagination system is officially working. High
    five. Now go make some cool gameplay. \n"
  type: 1
  icon: {fileID: 0}
